{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1757767713\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras_big/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1757767713 width=800 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenGrass is a 10\u201330 minute VR experience where you walk through a moody, stylized forest across three distinct days. Designed for performance and built in Unreal Engine, it combines the warm simplicity of sixth-gen console visuals with the presence only VR can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive under cover of night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the second day, the forest opens into something brighter, more atmospheric\u2014almost dreamlike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By evening, you retreat to a tent and settle in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no HUD, no objective markers, no distractions. Just you and the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Play in VR or 2D</strong> \u2013 Supports Meta PC VR and SteamVR headsets, as well as traditional flat-screen mode with gamepad or mouse/keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Three Narrative Days</strong> \u2013 Each part of the forest has a different feel, time, and emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Narrated Experience</strong> \u2013 A voice guides you through the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Designed like a sixth-gen game brought into VR: textured, colorful, and evocative\u2014not low-poly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Minimal HUD</strong> \u2013 Just the essentials: subtle prompts for grabbable items, nothing more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f <strong>Compact Length</strong> \u2013 Experience the full story in just 10\u201330 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb7 <strong>Priced Like a Coffee</strong> \u2013 \u00a34 for a tightly focused, atmospheric escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc63 <strong>No Combat, Just Presence</strong> \u2013 Explore at your pace. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Got Postcard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887140/6cb139721f206c5858ac9bacffe28d4f2f81a27a.jpg"},{"name":"Got All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887140/e7781a6f6eaaed39d7594248e9ec942d8df49ca0.jpg"},{"name":"Saw All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887140/5b871b608a151e719252cdc0968f6095c35cf1f9.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887140?t=1757767713","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887140?t=1757767713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/ad497a9014093d197b8992bb5c658c0f9841686e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757767713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/ad497a9014093d197b8992bb5c658c0f9841686e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757767713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap